WEBVTT

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:04.100
Hi, I'm Houda Mohandis,

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:06.600
owner of the Orientus channel.

00:00:06.980 --> 00:00:11.840
I wanted to make this video to recommend

00:00:12.230 --> 00:00:14.300
Mehdi Mouqtadir,

00:00:14.810 --> 00:00:18.910
for his support and all the work he did for me,

00:00:19.560 --> 00:00:22.640
helping me with my YouTube channel.

00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:25.300
At first, I was running this channel

00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:27.540
without much of a plan.

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:31.080
I didn't understand YouTube at all,

00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:36.090
and I'd even put the channel on pause for a long time.

00:00:36.450 --> 00:00:41.510
With his support, I got a much clearer vision.

00:00:41.920 --> 00:00:47.600
I understood exactly what to work on

00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:50.580
to make better videos.

00:00:51.060 --> 00:00:56.800
And it got me back to posting on YouTube.

00:00:56.800 --> 00:00:59.610
And honestly, the results were

00:01:00.050 --> 00:01:03.600
incredible: over 40,000 views

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:07.400
on the few videos I posted,

00:01:07.760 --> 00:01:09.710
over 2,000 subscribers, I think,

00:01:10.110 --> 00:01:13.900
in under two months of work.

00:01:14.330 --> 00:01:20.020
Mehdi is a young man with a lot of potential,

00:01:20.500 --> 00:01:23.990
who really knows the world of YouTube.

00:01:24.470 --> 00:01:28.990
I really recommend his services: he listens,

00:01:30.310 --> 00:01:35.390
he adapts his advice to what you need,

00:01:35.880 --> 00:01:41.130
he's very responsive, and full of creativity.

00:01:41.590 --> 00:01:44.400
It's a real pleasure to work with Mehdi,

00:01:44.400 --> 00:01:48.880
and I recommend him to every professional who wants to grow their YouTube channel.
